{"4077240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kaiju Princess Secret Pulse", "steam_appid": 4077240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six months ago, a sudden monster disaster devastated the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the catastrophe, the monsters fell completely silent—and <strong>Mika</strong>, the girl you had been searching for, vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when your investigation reaches a dead end, a mysterious woman named <strong>Xao</strong> suddenly appears before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She reveals that the monsters are connected to mysterious “Crystals” originating from an extraterrestrial civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there’s one unexpected catch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To awaken the Crystals’ true power, you must create a <strong>romantic resonance with girls?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find Mika and stop the monsters from awakening once again, you have no choice but to dive headfirst into an adventure where <strong>romance and battle collide!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💟 Gameplay 💟</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a live-action interactive story from a first-person perspective, where you will meet five different girls and build relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation and decision you make will influence how they feel about you—and determine how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But romance isn’t your only challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also harness the power of the mysterious Crystals to <strong>fight</strong>, defeat enemies, and gradually uncover the truth behind Mika’s disappearance and the monster disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall in love. Build your resonance. Gain new powers. Save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras/53e0d2d9f2bd2da426b5de178774dfb8.avif?t=1788305322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras_big/53e0d2d9f2bd2da426b5de178774dfb8.avif?t=1788305322 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💟 Features 💟</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person live-action interactive romance experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple heroines with unique routes and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful choices that shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic Resonance × Alien Crystal Powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters × Romance × Sci-Fi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live-action tokusatsu-style battle sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest live-action interactive title in the <strong>Monster Princess</strong> series</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras/43e7d4aa04407812c9adf9ba801a83c2.avif?t=1788305322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras_big/43e7d4aa04407812c9adf9ba801a83c2.avif?t=1788305322 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💟 Characters 💟</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Xao</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starring Kana Momonogi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras/b22c680d24e008b90994bcc013c1a94e.avif?t=1788305322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077240/extras_big/b22c680d24e008b90994bcc013c1a94e.avif?t=1788305322 width=1560 height=2340 /></span></